========================================
 UnifiFixer - U7/E7 sta_kickout fixer
========================================
Purpose: Re-applies the Qualcomm sta_kickout=320
         fix on UniFi U7/E7 APs so it survives
         reboots and reprovisions.

Useful commands:
  /usr/local/bin/reapply-kickout.sh     # run the fix now
  tail -20 /var/log/kickout-fix.log     # view recent runs
  crontab -l                            # show schedule

  # Check recent kickouts on the AP:
  ssh -i /root/.ssh/unifi_ap OSNXVb0Va96J@192.168.1.77 "dmesg | grep -i kickout | tail -10"

Schedule: on boot + every 15 minutes
========================================
